<title>USA: BT Office posts higher Q4 net.</title>
<headline>BT Office posts higher Q4 net.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in millions of dollars</p>
<p>except per share amounts.</p>
<p>			   Q4 96    Q4 95	YR 96    YR 95</p>
<p> Shr (dollars)	 0.12	0.11	 0.44     0.24</p>
<p> Net income	    4.0	 3.7	 14.7	6.7</p>
<p> Oper income	  10.3	 9.8	 38.2     28.7</p>
<p> Sales		 375.9     309.9    1,412.5  1,132.4</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   33,471    33,507     33,687   27,975</p>
<p>NOTE - BT Office Products International Inc is an</p>
<p>office products distributor. Dutch group NV Koninklijke KNP BT</p>
<p>owns about 70 pct of the company.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
